        "name": "食谱：白灵果酿鸡",
        "desc": "步骤详实的食谱,记载着「白灵果酿鸡」的制作方法。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/01/9cdbd4c12d8b09d21f658dff3b243948_8192890729192548674.png",
